## Why Tasks Cannot Be Parallelized

- `add-openai-tts-provider` needs the server config contract from `add-server-tts-env-contract`.
- `add-tts-provider-router-and-idempotency` needs the provider implementation before it can delegate generation and compute stable billing-control hashes.
- `add-translation-artifact-storage-helpers` needs the router's format metadata and idempotency shape before writing generated audio metadata.
- The tasks modify adjacent runtime surfaces where drift would create subtle integration failures.

